  Convosation:
  - SpeakerName: Hegemol
    Description:
    - Hello there what are you digging at?
  - SpeakerName: Dresh
    Description:
    - oh hello sorry i didnt notice you must of been to focused on digging
  - SpeakerName: Hegemol
    Description:
    - ...
  - SpeakerName: Dresh
    Description:
    - OH right yes sorry i was digging at a fossel from the old times which are scatered
      across low lands
    - Like for example the Ravanus Gaps and even more so in the silken ridge which
      seamingly the base site for the accents
  - SpeakerName: Hegemol
    Description:
    - Right... so that would make you a?
  - SpeakerName: Dresh
    Description:
    - that would make me a archeolagist...
    - Thoes who studdies bug history and prehistory by excavating sites and analyzing
      artifacts and structures like this one for example
  - SpeakerName: Hegemol
    Description:
    - i guess your digging for Delights
  - SpeakerName: Dresh
    Description:
    - Ah yes i suppose you could say that how funny haha
    - well if you have any other jokes of the same sort or even any relics you find
      on your traval be sure to show them to me or Helick in the ruins Museum
    - But it also seams you dont have a Climbing gear which is bad as this area has
      no easy footholds here i will give you my spare pare these are good but are
      limmited in function so i suggest replacing them soon
